</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/cfa934c8-89f8-11f1-9e2e-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/6a63cfc30abdd886191236.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/cfa934c8-89f8-11f1-9e2e-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/6a63cfc30abdd886191236.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">d4295b36-89f8-11f1-9c1d-55a3ef88b1dc</guid><pubDate>Mon, 27 Jul 2026 20:22:01 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/cfa934c8-89f8-11f1-9e2e-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/6a63cfc30abdd886191236.jpg">© AIZAR RALDES / AFP</source><dc:creator>法广</dc:creator></item><item><category>美洲</category><title>中科技突破致美国芯片股重挫    华尔街股市应声下跌</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E7%BE%8E%E6%B4%B2/20260727-%E4%B8%AD%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E7%AA%81%E7%A0%B4%E8%87%B4%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E8%8A%AF%E7%89%87%E8%82%A1%E9%87%8D%E6%8C%AB-%E5%8D%8E%E5%B0%94%E8%A1%97%E8%82%A1%E5%B8%82%E5%BA%94%E5%A3%B0%E4%B8%8B%E8%B7%8C</link><description>
